  "why": "Hell Mode second season, a summer 2026 TV run starting 2026-07-04 and ending 2026-09-18, still on air at labelling time; AniList counts 13 episodes where MyAnimeList and AniZip count 12. AniZip 19978 is the same run: SAME_AS ids to mal:63817 and anilist:209983, the MyAnimeList episode count of 12, and a first episode dated 2026-07-03, the run's own start weekend. The JustWatch season 504764-574803 is the same run: it maps SAME_AS onto all four members and onto anizip:19978 and lists ten of AniZip's episode titles in the same order, differing only in being set in capitals. The Netflix title 82703566 is a bare container: it has no season of its own, no episode count and no dates, its episodes are placeholders numbered Episode 1 to Episode 12, and JustWatch already records it as a PART_OF container for this season, so it holds the run instead of merging with it. AniZip episodes 1 to 10 pair with the JustWatch ones on those titles (Off to Academy City! through Plentiful Prayers). No range is claimed inside the Netflix container: it publishes no episode dates and its episode labels are generic, so its twelve positions cannot be placed against the run's. AniZip episode 11 (2026-09-11) carries only a Japanese title and episode 12 none at all, and Kitsu lists 22 untitled, undated episode rows against this 12 episode season, so none of those are paired."
